flowchart LR
    command[Command<br/>封裝一次操作] --> scene[Scene<br/>正式內容]
    command --> undo[Undo Stack]
    undo -->|Undo| redo[Redo Stack]
    redo -->|Redo| undo
    undo -. 還原 .-> scene
    redo -. 重做 .-> scene

    classDef step fill:#f4f6fb,stroke:#49566b,color:#111,stroke-width:1px;
    class command,scene,undo,redo step;
